# Every environment variable used by this project, one per line, with a comment.
# Copy to .env (never commit .env). The plugin has no runtime config file of its own:
# these are read from the Claude Code environment (settings env) and are checked, not required.
# Lines are commented out on purpose; uncomment only to experiment.

# Set by Claude Code when it runs the hooks and commands (do not set by hand):
# CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT=          plugin root used by hooks/hooks.json to locate scripts/
# CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA=          plugin data dir; the session audit goes to $CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA/audits/
# CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR=          project directory used by init-project and skills inventory

# Read by the scripts; set in Claude Code settings env when needed:
# CLAUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_DIRS=     path list of plugin directories scanned by scripts/skills_inventory.py

# Checked by the SessionStart policy (warnings only). Expected values in brackets:
# CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_SUBAGENT_SPAWN_DEPTH=   [1] subagent spawn depth limit
# CLAUDE_CODE_EFFORT_LEVEL=               [unset] would override the effort of every tier
# CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL=             [unset] would override the model of every tier
# CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL_FORCE=       [unset] forces the subagent model override
